														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1017434">
									

<p>I really don't know. On the one hand, it's kind of interesting, but on the other it's too friendly for my tastes. I feel like I'm supposed to be sad for it, but as a reader I don't find myself feeling sympathetic enough for that to carry the proper oomph as the article's driving force.</p>
<p>Additionally, while the idea of communication based entirely on projected images is interesting, the attempt to verbally convey esoteric concepts isn't doing the tone of your article any favors. Consider playing around with the log format to make the writing more clinical; remember that it was likely written by someone who wasn't present. Also, lose the random asterisks.</p>

							</div>

								
